      "rule_text": "边界：医疗功效声明（治疗/治愈/诊断/疏通堵奶/治疗或预防乳腺炎；边界允许：缓解涨奶 ease/relieve engorgement、降低堵奶风险 reduce the risk of clogged、支持奶阵 let-down）；触发词：treat, cure, heal, remedy, diagnos, 治疗, 治愈, 诊断, 疗法, 根治, unclog, unclog ducts, unblock ducts, clear clogged, clear blocked, fix clogged, treat clogged, treat plugged, treat engorgement, cure engorgement, cure mastitis, treat mastitis, prevent mastitis, prevents mastitis, prevent clogged, prevent plugged, stop mastitis, engorgement treatment, clogged duct treatment, plugged duct treatment, 疏通堵奶, 疏通乳腺, 通乳腺, 解决堵奶, 治疗堵奶, 预防堵奶, 治疗涨奶, 治疗乳腺炎, 预防乳腺炎, 治愈乳腺炎, 解决乳腺炎, 根治乳腺炎, heat therapy for mastitis, heat therapy for clogged, warmth treats clogged, warmth treats mastitis, thermal therapy, residual milk, remove residual milk, reduces residual milk, clear residual milk, prevent nipple damage, reduce nipple damage, prevents nipple damage, reduces nipple damage, nipple damage prevention, 热敷治疗, 热敷通奶, 加热治疗, 热敷疏通, 通堵奶, 疏通乳腺管, 排残奶, 残余奶, 残留乳汁, 五条乳腺管, 五区对应乳腺, 预防乳头损伤, 减少乳头损伤, 防止乳头损伤, 避免乳头损伤, 乳头损伤预防；豁免：treat yourself, doesn't treat, does not treat, do not treat, not intended to treat, not to treat, not a treatment, not a medical device, not intended to cure, doesn't cure, cannot cure, can't cure, 不用于治疗, 不是治疗, 不能治疗, 不可治疗, 不可以治疗, 不能治愈, 无法治疗, 并非治疗, relieve engorgement, relieves engorgement, relieving engorgement, engorgement relief, ease engorgement, eases engorgement, easing engorgement, soothe engorgement, soothes engorgement, soulage les engorgements, soulager les engorgements, reduce the risk of clogged, reduces the risk of clogged, reducing the risk of clogged, reduce the risk of plugged, risk of clogged ducts, risk of plugged ducts, or cure, or treat, cannot treat, can't treat, does not cure, do not cure, won't cure",
